    "%1$@ has been unable to communicate with the pod on your body since %2$@.\n\nDo not Discard the Pod without scrolling to read this entire screen.\n\nCommunication was interrupted at a critical time. Information about active insulin / pod temp basal rate is uncertain.\n\nYou can toggle phone Bluetooth off and on or quit and restart the app. (Wait up to 30 seconds for recovery.)\n\nIf you decide to give up because communication cannot be restored, tap the Discard Pod button, follow the steps and start a new pod.\nMonitor your glucose closely for the next 6 hours, as there may or may not be insulin actively working in your body that %3$@ cannot display." : {
      "comment" : "Format string for main text of delivery uncertainty recovery page. (1: app name)(2: date of command)(3: app name)",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ has been unable to communicate with the pod on your body since %2$@.\n\nDo not Discard the Pod without scrolling to read this entire screen.\n\nCommunication was interrupted at a critical time. Information about active insulin / pod temp basal rate is uncertain.\n\nYou can toggle phone Bluetooth off and on or quit and restart the app. (Wait up to 30 seconds for recovery.)\n\nIf you decide to give up because communication cannot be restored, tap the Discard Pod button, follow the steps and start a new pod.\nMonitor your glucose closely for the next 6 hours, as there may or may not be insulin actively working in your body that %3$@ cannot display."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ has been unable to communicate with the pod on your body since %2$@.\n\nDo not Discard the Pod without scrolling to read this entire screen.\n\nCommunication was interrupted at a critical time. Information about active insulin / pod temp basal rate is uncertain.\n\nYou can toggle phone Bluetooth off and on or quit and restart the app. (Wait up to 30 seconds for recovery.)\n\nIf you decide to give up because communication cannot be restored, tap the Discard Pod button, follow the steps and start a new pod.\nMonitor your glucose closely for the next 6 hours, as there may or may not be insulin actively working in your body that %3$@ cannot display."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ has been unable to communicate with the pod on your body since %2$@.\n\nDo not Discard the Pod without scrolling to read this entire screen.\n\nCommunication was interrupted at a critical time. Information about active insulin / pod temp basal rate is uncertain.\n\nYou can toggle phone Bluetooth off and on or quit and restart the app. (Wait up to 30 seconds for recovery.)\n\nIf you decide to give up because communication cannot be restored, tap the Discard Pod button, follow the steps and start a new pod.\nMonitor your glucose closely for the next 6 hours, as there may or may not be insulin actively working in your body that %3$@ cannot display."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ has been unable to communicate with the pod on your body since %2$@.\n\nDo not Discard the Pod without scrolling to read this entire screen.\n\nCommunication was interrupted at a critical time. Information about active insulin / pod temp basal rate is uncertain.\n\nYou can toggle phone Bluetooth off and on or quit and restart the app. (Wait up to 30 seconds for recovery.)\n\nIf you decide to give up because communication cannot be restored, tap the Discard Pod button, follow the steps and start a new pod.\nMonitor your glucose closely for the next 6 hours, as there may or may not be insulin actively working in your body that %3$@ cannot display."
          }
        },
        "fi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ has been unable to communicate with the pod on your body since %2$@.\n\nDo not Discard the Pod without scrolling to read this entire screen.\n\nCommunication was interrupted at a critical time. Information about active insulin / pod temp basal rate is uncertain.\n\nYou can toggle phone Bluetooth off and on or quit and restart the app. (Wait up to 30 seconds for recovery.)\n\nIf you decide to give up because communication cannot be restored, tap the Discard Pod button, follow the steps and start a new pod.\nMonitor your glucose closely for the next 6 hours, as there may or may not be insulin actively working in your body that %3$@ cannot display."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ n'a pas pu communiquer avec le pod sur votre corps depuis %2$@. \n \nNe jetez pas le pod sans avoir fait défiler l'écran pour lire l'intégralité de cet écran. \n \nLa communication a été interrompue à un moment critique. Les informations sur l'insuline active / le débit basal temporaire du pod sont incertaines. \n \nVous pouvez activer et désactiver le Bluetooth du téléphone ou quitter et redémarrer l'application. (Attendez jusqu'à 30 secondes pour la récupération.) \n \nSi vous décidez d'abandonner parce que la communication ne peut pas être rétablie, appuyez sur le bouton Jeter le pod, suivez les étapes et démarrez un nouveau pod. \n Surveillez attentivement votre glycémie pendant les 6 prochaines heures, car il peut y avoir ou non de l'insuline active dans votre corps que %3$@ ne peut pas afficher."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ has been unable to communicate with the pod on your body since %2$@.\n\nDo not Discard the Pod without scrolling to read this entire screen.\n\nCommunication was interrupted at a critical time. Information about active insulin / pod temp basal rate is uncertain.\n\nYou can toggle phone Bluetooth off and on or quit and restart the app. (Wait up to 30 seconds for recovery.)\n\nIf you decide to give up because communication cannot be restored, tap the Discard Pod button, follow the steps and start a new pod.\nMonitor your glucose closely for the next 6 hours, as there may or may not be insulin actively working in your body that %3$@ cannot display."
          }
        },
