        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ non è riuscito a comunicare con il Pod sul tuo corpo da %2$@. \n \nNon scartare il Pod senza aver letto completamente questa schermata. \n \nLa comunicazione è stata interrotta in un momento critico. Le informazioni sull'insulina attiva/velocità basale temporanea del Pod sono incerte. \n \nPuoi disattivare e riattivare il Bluetooth del telefono o uscire e riavviare l'app. (Attendi fino a 30 secondi per il ripristino.) \n \nSe decidi di rinunciare perché la comunicazione non può essere ripristinata, tocca il pulsante \"Scarta Pod\", segui i passaggi e avvia un nuovo Pod. \nMonitora attentamente la glicemia per le prossime 6 ore, poiché potrebbe esserci o meno insulina attiva nel tuo corpo che %3$@ non può visualizzare."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ har ikke vært i stand til å kommunisere med pod på kroppen din siden %2$@.\n\nIkke kast pod uten å bla for å lese hele beskjeden.\n\nKommunikasjonen ble avbrutt på et kritisk tidspunkt. Informasjon om aktivt insulin / podens midlertidige basalhastighet er usikker.\n\nDu kan slå telefonens Bluetooth av og på, eller avslutte og starte appen på nytt. (Vent i opptil 30 sekunder på gjenoppretting.)\n\nHvis du bestemmer deg for å gi opp fordi kommunikasjonen ikke kan gjenopprettes, trykk på Kast pod-knappen, følg trinnene og start en ny pod.\nOvervåk blodsukkeret dit nøye de neste 6 timene, da det kan være insulin som aktivt virker i kroppen din som %3$@ ikke kan vise."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ is sinds %2$@niet in staat om te communiceren met de pod op je lichaam.\n\nVerwijder de Pod niet zonder te scrollen om dit hele scherm te lezen.\n\nCommunicatie werd op een kritiek moment onderbroken Informatie over de actieve insuline / pod tijdelijke basaalstand is onduidelijk.\n\nJe kunt RileyLink-verbinding (hieronder) aan-/uitzetten. Schakel Bluetooth van je telefoon uit en aan; zet het RileyLink-apparaat uit en aan; of probeer een andere RileyLink uit. Wacht tot 30 seconden op herstel.\n\nAls je besluit om op te geven omdat de communicatie niet kan worden hersteld. tik op de knop Verwijderen van Pod, volg de stappen en start een nieuwe pod.\nVolg jouw glucose goed voor de komende 6 uur. Als er al dan niet insuline actief werkt in je lichaam dat %3$@ niet kan tonen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ has been unable to communicate with the pod on your body since %2$@.\n\nDo not Discard the Pod without scrolling to read this entire screen.\n\nCommunication was interrupted at a critical time. Information about active insulin / pod temp basal rate is uncertain.\n\nYou can toggle phone Bluetooth off and on or quit and restart the app. (Wait up to 30 seconds for recovery.)\n\nIf you decide to give up because communication cannot be restored, tap the Discard Pod button, follow the steps and start a new pod.\nMonitor your glucose closely for the next 6 hours, as there may or may not be insulin actively working in your body that %3$@ cannot display."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ has been unable to communicate with the pod on your body since %2$@.\n\nDo not Discard the Pod without scrolling to read this entire screen.\n\nCommunication was interrupted at a critical time. Information about active insulin / pod temp basal rate is uncertain.\n\nYou can toggle phone Bluetooth off and on or quit and restart the app. (Wait up to 30 seconds for recovery.)\n\nIf you decide to give up because communication cannot be restored, tap the Discard Pod button, follow the steps and start a new pod.\nMonitor your glucose closely for the next 6 hours, as there may or may not be insulin actively working in your body that %3$@ cannot display."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ has been unable to communicate with the pod on your body since %2$@.\n\nDo not Discard the Pod without scrolling to read this entire screen.\n\nCommunication was interrupted at a critical time. Information about active insulin / pod temp basal rate is uncertain.\n\nYou can toggle phone Bluetooth off and on or quit and restart the app. (Wait up to 30 seconds for recovery.)\n\nIf you decide to give up because communication cannot be restored, tap the Discard Pod button, follow the steps and start a new pod.\nMonitor your glucose closely for the next 6 hours, as there may or may not be insulin actively working in your body that %3$@ cannot display."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ has been unable to communicate with the pod on your body since %2$@.\n\nDo not Discard the Pod without scrolling to read this entire screen.\n\nCommunication was interrupted at a critical time. Information about active insulin / pod temp basal rate is uncertain.\n\nYou can toggle phone Bluetooth off and on or quit and restart the app. (Wait up to 30 seconds for recovery.)\n\nIf you decide to give up because communication cannot be restored, tap the Discard Pod button, follow the steps and start a new pod.\nMonitor your glucose closely for the next 6 hours, as there may or may not be insulin actively working in your body that %3$@ cannot display."
          }
        },
        "sk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ has been unable to communicate with the pod on your body since %2$@.\n\nDo not Discard the Pod without scrolling to read this entire screen.\n\nCommunication was interrupted at a critical time. Information about active insulin / pod temp basal rate is uncertain.\n\nYou can toggle phone Bluetooth off and on or quit and restart the app. (Wait up to 30 seconds for recovery.)\n\nIf you decide to give up because communication cannot be restored, tap the Discard Pod button, follow the steps and start a new pod.\nMonitor your glucose closely for the next 6 hours, as there may or may not be insulin actively working in your body that %3$@ cannot display."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ har inte kunnat kommunicera med podden på din kropp sedan %2$@.\n\nInaktivera inte din podd utan att först läsa hela meddelandet.\n\nKommunikationen avbröts vid en kritisk tidpunkt. Information om aktiv insulin / pod temp basal är osäker.\n\nDu kan växla RileyLink-anslutning (nedan), växla telefonen Bluetooth från och på; stänga av och på; eller prova en annan RileyLink. Vänta upp till 30 sekunder.\n\nOm du väljer att avbryta eftersom kommunikation inte kan återställas, tryck då på knappen Kasta podd, följ stegen och starta sedan en ny podd.\nÖvervaka ditt glukos noggrant de närmaste 6 timmarna eftersom det kan finnas aktivt insulin i din kropp som %3$@ inte kan visa."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ has been unable to communicate with the pod on your body since %2$@.\n\nDo not Discard the Pod without scrolling to read this entire screen.\n\nCommunication was interrupted at a critical time. Information about active insulin / pod temp basal rate is uncertain.\n\nYou can toggle phone Bluetooth off and on or quit and restart the app. (Wait up to 30 seconds for recovery.)\n\nIf you decide to give up because communication cannot be restored, tap the Discard Pod button, follow the steps and start a new pod.\nMonitor your glucose closely for the next 6 hours, as there may or may not be insulin actively working in your body that %3$@ cannot display."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ has been unable to communicate with the pod on your body since %2$@.\n\nDo not Discard the Pod without scrolling to read this entire screen.\n\nCommunication was interrupted at a critical time. Information about active insulin / pod temp basal rate is uncertain.\n\nYou can toggle phone Bluetooth off and on or quit and restart the app. (Wait up to 30 seconds for recovery.)\n\nIf you decide to give up because communication cannot be restored, tap the Discard Pod button, follow the steps and start a new pod.\nMonitor your glucose closely for the next 6 hours, as there may or may not be insulin actively working in your body that %3$@ cannot display."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ không thể liên lạc với pod trên cơ thể bạn kể từ %2$@.\n\nĐừng vứt Pod mà chưa kéo xuống đọc hết màn hình này.\n\nLiên lạc đã bị gián đoạn vào thời điểm quan trọng. Thông tin về insulin đang hoạt động / tỷ lệ basal tạm thời của pod hiện không chắc chắn.\n\nBạn có thể:\n\nBật/tắt Bluetooth của điện thoại,\n\nHoặc thoát và khởi động lại ứng dụng.\n\n(Đợi tối đa 30 giây để khôi phục kết nối.)\n\nNếu bạn quyết định từ bỏ vì không thể khôi phục liên lạc, hãy nhấn nút Vứt Pod (Discard Pod), làm theo các bước và bắt đầu một pod mới.\n\nTheo dõi sát đường huyết trong 6 giờ tới, vì có thể hoặc không có insulin đang hoạt động trong cơ thể mà %3$@ không thể hiển thị."
          }
        },
        "yy-YY" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ has been unable to communicate with the pod on your body since %2$@.\n\nDo not Discard the Pod without scrolling to read this entire screen.\n\nCommunication was interrupted at a critical time. Information about active insulin / pod temp basal rate is uncertain.\n\nYou can toggle phone Bluetooth off and on or quit and restart the app. (Wait up to 30 seconds for recovery.)\n\nIf you decide to give up because communication cannot be restored, tap the Discard Pod button, follow the steps and start a new pod.\nMonitor your glucose closely for the next 6 hours, as there may or may not be insulin actively working in your body that %3$@ cannot display."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ has been unable to communicate with the pod on your body since %2$@.\n\nDo not Discard the Pod without scrolling to read this entire screen.\n\nCommunication was interrupted at a critical time. Information about active insulin / pod temp basal rate is uncertain.\n\nYou can toggle phone Bluetooth off and on or quit and restart the app. (Wait up to 30 seconds for recovery.)\n\nIf you decide to give up because communication cannot be restored, tap the Discard Pod button, follow the steps and start a new pod.\nMonitor your glucose closely for the next 6 hours, as there may or may not be insulin actively working in your body that %3$@ cannot display."
